WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.924
Esto empezó antes y sigue ahora.

00:00:04.228 --> 00:00:05.995
I’ve lived here for two years.

00:00:06.607 --> 00:00:08.156
For indica duración:

00:00:08.753 --> 00:00:09.463
two years.

00:00:11.085 --> 00:00:13.057
I’ve lived here since twenty twenty-four.

00:00:13.732 --> 00:00:16.003
Since señala cuándo empezó:

00:00:16.688 --> 00:00:17.670
twenty twenty-four.

00:00:18.968 --> 00:00:19.440
Ahora tú:

00:00:20.195 --> 00:00:22.753
I’ve studied English… six months.

00:00:23.309 --> 00:00:24.646
¿Since o for?

00:00:29.052 --> 00:00:29.875
Clases en línea:

00:00:30.407 --> 00:00:32.107
manda GRUPO por mensaje privado.
